OL,3,GNEWSAMain Post Office branch to close
OL,4,Ain November
OL,5,
OL,6,FCustomers have been told to expect
OL,7,Fdisruption to services after a main
OL,8,FPost Office branch closes.
OL,10,FThe branch, located inside the TG Jones
OL,11,Fstore at the Kings Chase Shopping
OL,12,FCentre in Kingswood, Bristol, is
OL,13,Fscheduled to shut on 18 November.
OL,15,FLocal resident William Baker said: " I
OL,16,Fwill miss it because it's the only one
OL,17,FI can get to at my age. I get my meals
OL,18,Fdelivered and I go to the post office
OL,19,Fto pay for them. Where am I going to go
OL,20,Fwhen that's shut?"
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
