OL,3,GNEWSAMain Post Office branch to close
OL,4,Ain November
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure is a direct result of a
OL,7,Fcommercial decision by TG Jones, which
OL,8,Fis shutting its retail branch following
OL,9,Fa major High Court-approved
OL,10,Frestructuring plan.
